			"value": " c",
			"start": 819,
			"end": 823
		},
		{
			"type": "Line",
			"value": " An empty body has nothing to break, so it stays on the call's line, unless a",
			"start": 1014,
			"end": 1093
		},
		{
			"type": "Line",
			"value": " decorator puts the class on lines of its own",
			"start": 1095,
			"end": 1142
		},
		{
			"type": "Line",
			"value": " Positions: an assignment, a nested argument",
			"start": 1218,
